  (text_box "ESP32-H2-WROOM-02C\nRISC-V 96MHz, 802.15.4 + BLE\nMatter over Thread\nSED / ICD (SIT/LIT)\n\nIO1  ADC1_CH0  SOIL_ADC\nIO2  ADC1_CH1  VBAT_ADC\nIO3  ADC1_CH2  NTC_ADC\nIO10 SENS_PWR_EN_N\nIO11 VBAT_MEAS_EN\nIO12/IO22 I2C SDA/SCL\nIO9  nut BOOT/USER\nIO0  LED\nIO23/24 UART0, IO26/27 USB"
